<title>NEW ZEALAND: Affco expects 1997 result well down on 96.</title>
<headline>Affco expects 1997 result well down on 96.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meat processor AFFCO Ltd said on Thursday it expects its full year result to be well down on the 1996 result.  </p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				  2.8 vs 5.5</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  2.5 vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Turnover				   451.1 vs 414.4</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     5.55 vs 10.69</p>
<p>    Tax					   0.45 vs 0.20</p>
<p>    Equity earnings			   0.70 vs 0.46</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	204.59 vs same</p>
</text>
